=== ARCHITECTURE DECISIONS ===
  • Data seam: own protocol `SecretRotationSource` + `InMemorySecretRotationSource` (NO `import Shared`) so the page
    host-compiles WITHOUT the unstaged KMP xcframework. The web page is driven by `useSecretRotation` (TanStack query
    `{ items, isLoading, error }`); the native model elevates that into the P1/S8 cache-then-network load state and the
    view performs ZERO HTTP. A `SecretRotationPageModel(items:loading:)` web-prop initializer preserves the query shape.
  • Load state: self-contained `SecretRotationLoadState` + `SecretRotationPageError` mirroring the facade `LoadableState`/
    `FacadeError` SHAPE (cached-behind-refresh, ADR-013 stale, offline-keeps-cache, retryable) — so the production binding
    is a 1:1 map and every branch is unit-testable. `error.isSubsystemUnavailable` reproduces the web `error.status===503`
    branch → the "Subsystem unavailable" banner instead of an error.
  • i18n: per-surface `.strings` table + `SecretRotationStrings` facade (NSLocalizedString tableName + value fallback,
    plus `{{token}}` interpolation for criticalMessage/daysToExpiry) — parallel-safe; the shared Localizable.xcstrings is
    NOT edited (Honesty rule 7). Every visible literal resolves through the facade with the verbatim web English default.
  • Table: hand-composed (not the shared `TSDataTable`) because TSDataTable takes main-catalog `LocalizedStringKey`
    headers (no per-surface fallback) and always renders a selection column the read-only report does not have — the same
    disposition the AuditPanel log records. The shared `TSTone` (severity color), `TSIconBox` (stat-card icon), and
    `TSSkeleton` (loading) ARE reused; the empty state is the shared `ContentUnavailableView` pattern with facade `Text`.
  • Navigation: `SecretRotationRouteRegistration.registry(model:)` hosts the page at the `.admin` destination through the
    existing `AppRouteHostRegistry` seam (the same idiom `SettingsRouteRegistration` uses). The web deep link
    `/admin/secret-rotation` resolves to `.admin` via `AppRouteParser` (firstSegment), so this is the route entry. The
    shared `AppRoute` enum / parser are NOT mutated (parallel-safe; the route model groups admin pages under `.admin`).
  • Telemetry: REUSES the canonical `DashboardWidgetTelemetryEvent` / `DashboardWidgetTelemetrySink` /
    `BufferedDashboardWidgetTelemetry` (Sources/DashboardWidgets/BatteryCellsWidgetRegistry.swift) — the app-wide P1/S11
    diagnostics seam. `SecretRotationPage.viewOpenedEvent == .viewOpened(surface:"SecretRotationPage")`, emitted on `.task`.
  • Units note: the day counts / thresholds are integers from the Go tracker (`internal/rotation/tracker.go`, all `int`);
    no SI-unit conversion is involved, so the Phase-48 SI-canonical rules do not apply. Display formatting (grouped int,
    absolute datetime, relative caption) happens at the render boundary in the projection — never stored.

